# Generated fixtures are byte-for-byte artefacts: VerifyFixtures reports exact
# character counts and manifest.json records them. Without -text, git rewrites
# the .txt CVs to CRLF on a Windows checkout, every count shifts, and the
# corpus no longer matches its own documentation. The sources in content/ are
# ordinary text and are left to normal handling.
cvs/** -text
adversarial/** -text
